# Network Discovery – Scanta-Clause CTF Write-Up

## 1. Initial Recon – Nmap Scan
Performed a default Nmap scan on the target `10.49.134.100` to check top 1000 ports.

**Results:**
- 22/tcp – SSH
- 80/tcp – HTTP

Ran full port scan:

nmap -p- 10.49.134.100

**Additional open ports:**
- 21212/tcp – vsFTPd 3.0.5
- 25251/tcp – TBFC maintd v0.2

